rie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><div class=\"table-wrapper\"><table style=\"border-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);line-height:1;font-size:16px;min-width:25px;border-collapse:collapse;\" class=\"\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\"><colgroup><col></colgroup><tbody><tr><td><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2026/02/05/50494840/50f11db7386fb5181d6961c42c6562bf_5137709363739749261.gif\" href=\"\" style=\"width:775px;border:none;vertical-align:middle;\"></p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></li></ul> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 2;\"> <div data-part=\"skill\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--skill obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器技能</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">威光赫赫，长夜将明</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">同调(I&nbsp;/II&nbsp;/III)阶</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">敌人受到来自场上角色造成的全伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\">（</span><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">2.0%/4.0%/6.0%</span>）</strong>（该效果为独立加成）（唯一生效）</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">镇×偃月叩晓装备时，敌人受到来自自身的物理伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(0,0,0,1)\">（</span><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">2.0%/4.0%/6.0%</span>）</strong>（该效果为独立加成）</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">安与佑的护持</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><strong><span style=\"color:rgba(250,140,22,1)\">[能量消耗:0][冷却:0秒]</span></strong>武器主动技能的冷却时间、充能次数、技能效果由装备角色的类型决定，若装备佩戴者具有<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>复盈相生</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;技能：角色的能力特性之一，拥有此特性的角色可在&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;星环爆发&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;状态下提高共享能量上限并回复大量能量和&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;烁迹&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>特性，则造成的物理伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">15.0%</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">镇×偃月叩晓装备，且自身为队长时：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">●<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>星环爆发</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：星之环中的特殊强化状态，根据加护赋予角色特殊能力&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>时能量初始值额外提高能量上限的10%</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">●释放<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>镇岁斩</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(64,64,64,1)&quot;&gt;技能：拥有2层&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(19,194,194,1)&quot;&gt;&lt;u&gt;刀势&lt;/u&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:rgba(64,64,64,1)&quot;&gt;后可以释放的第三段强力攻击，可直接击败生物属性的非首领敌人&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>期间触发<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(19,194,194,1)\"><u>时滞领域</u></span></strong><span data-type=\"详情\" data-name=\"&lt;p style=&quot;white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;状态：【时滞领域】效果期间角色、敌人身上的技能效果以及关卡都会停止计时&lt;/p&gt;\" class=\"wiki-note-text\"><sup class=\"wiki-sup\">[详情]</sup></span>效果</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">宵与晓的守候</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">自身造成的暴击伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">20.0%</span></strong>，镇×偃月叩晓装备时：</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">●敌人受到来自自身造成的全伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">15.0%</span></strong></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">●全队角色造成的全伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">15.0%</span></strong>，全元素伤害提高<strong><span style=\"color:rgba(24,144,255,1)\">15.0%</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 3;\"> <div data-part=\"gainMethod\" data-tmpl=\"general\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-general obc-tmpl__part--gainMethod obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>获取途径</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">补给获取</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">装备补给</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"h3\">大伟哥别墅</td> <td colspan=\"5\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">消耗<a href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1180/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\" data-type=\"obc-content\" target=\"_blank\">大伟哥黑金卡</a>兑换获得</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 4;\"> <div data-part=\"material\" data-tmpl=\"stigmata\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-stigmata obc-tmpl__part--material obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>进化材料</h2> <table class=\"obc-tmpl__gain-method\"><colgroup><col> <col></colgroup> <thead><tr><th>突破等级</th> <th colspan=\"5\">所需材料</th></tr></thead> <tbody><tr><td class=\"h3\">35</td> <td colspan=\"5\"><div class=\"material-td\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1132/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">三分结晶</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*3</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1890/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\"><!----><span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text\">流体合金块</span></a> <span class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-num\">*1</span></div><div class=\"obc-tmpl__icon-text-num\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"/bh3/wiki/content/1273/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_heade