d.mihoyo.com/bh3-wiki/2026/02/05/50494840/261dc2abf1692e87fe3f75c0569c9aac_2655214513160063616.png\" alt=\"\"></div> <span>镇×偃月叩晓</span></div></td> <td><div class=\"obc-tmpl-weapon__role-stars\"><span>推荐指数</span> <div><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i><i class=\"obc-tmpl__rate-icon\"></i></div></div></td> <td colspan=\"3\" class=\"obc-tmpl__rich-text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">推荐武器。提高输出、辅助和循环能力。</p></td></tr></tbody></table> <!----></div></div><div style=\"order: 1;\"> <div data-part=\"review\" data-tmpl=\"weapon\" class=\"obc-tmpl__part obc-tmpl-weapon obc-tmpl__part--review obc-tmpl__part--align-banner\"><h2>武器测评</h2> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-container\"><div><img src=\"\" class=\"mobile-gif\"></div> <div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item\"><div class=\"obc-tmpl-valkyrie__skill-item-desc\"><div class=\"text\"><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【同调技能】提高敌人受到来自场上角色造成的全伤（独立加成、唯一生效）。镇×偃月叩晓装备时为敌人施加来自自身的物理易伤（独立加成）。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; min-height: 1.5em;\"></p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【通用性能】常驻暴伤，佩戴者具有复盈相生特性时物伤提高。</p><p style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\">【角色相性】镇×偃月叩晓装备时，敌人受到来自自身的全伤提高，全队全伤、全元素伤害提高。星环爆发时能量初始值额外提高，镇岁斩期间提供时滞领域效果。</p></div> <!----></div></div></div> <!----></div></div></div></div></div> <div data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__body-endpart\"><hr data-v-f0365338=\"\"> <p data-v-f0365338=\"\" class=\"detail__copyright\"><img data-v-f0365338=\"\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\">\n        词条内容由圣芙蕾雅档案馆编辑团队原创，禁止转载\n      </p></div> <!---->",
